{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_erato_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_erato_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"英雄們的敘事詩","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_erato_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"0679b62d66178846eddbda00e78606d6114b63215af8919cb2f406cde1c8bf6e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"埃拉托著手撰寫一部新的詩篇，她決定在羅德島上就地取材。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕咚，咕咚——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，美酒的芬芳，真令人陶醉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開門，埃拉托小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃拉托——你把自己關在裡面也想不出來的，我建議你放棄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酗酒祭司，你太吵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是關心你，埃拉托小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨夜我徜徉美酒之時，偶然聽到幹員們的交談，聽聞你將自己關在宿舍裡兩天兩夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身為祭司，我自然牽掛著你的情況。你看，清晨的日光才剛剛鋪滿窗沿，我就前來探望你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"探望我......你手上拎著的是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佳釀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米諾斯的群山啊，可否賜予我不被酒品奇差之人騷擾的恩澤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你尚有諷刺的力氣，新詩篇的創作一定很順利吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎麼知道我正在創作一部新的詩篇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來到羅德島之後，你已經遊手好閒夠久了......準備寫點什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一部長篇詩歌，講述幾位所長不同、性格各異的英雄，合力帶領備受壓迫的人們戰勝困難，共同前往希望之地......大概是這樣的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而在開始動筆時，我還是遇上阻礙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一字未動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡說，我......至少寫上了標題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在故事前期，我設想了三位英雄，分別是善戰的勇士、天才的工匠和仁愛的醫生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可由於擱筆太久，我對角色的理解已經生疏了，構思的故事缺乏真實感，角色形象難以建立......我需要更多的靈感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如就像我們在故鄉那樣，一邊痛飲美酒，一邊暢敘諸山之間的英雄傳說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酣醉之時，靈感便如樹上熟透的果實一般任你採摘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請不要為你帶酒上門找理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"翻閱典籍，或是外出進行采風米諾斯的詩人們善用這些方法，你應當比我更清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我這不就準備出發去尋找英雄事蹟了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起英雄事蹟，除我們的故鄉外，維多利亞與卡西米爾應該是合適的采風地，或許還有其他的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會跑這麼遠，我已經想好要去哪些地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閒聊還是下次吧，我得抓緊時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請留步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃拉托小姐如何創作詩篇，我一直對此非常感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一次難逢的機會，若我想與你同行，你應該不會拒絕吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟上我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡就是我計劃的第一站。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出乎意料，埃拉托小姐，原來你就沒有計劃離開羅德島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然啦，在本艦上就足夠我尋找靈感了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起善戰的勇士，那必定是在訓練室最容易遇上了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我們來太早了嗎？似乎沒有人在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈，這拳如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人在說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也聽到了——你好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘗嘗這拳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是燧石小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你是帕拉斯，還有你，你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你個子不高，也很少來訓練場打架，我不記得你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫埃拉托，大部分時間都在出外勤任務，我們確實只有幾面之緣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"好，你們好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，埃拉托，要來打架嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！怎麼突然——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想打架，那算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我不擅長近身格鬥，射箭的話倒是可以比試一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"（轉向沙袋）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等待一下吧，這個時間，再過一陣子就會有其他幹員前來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃拉托小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然過去就聽過燧石小姐很厲害，但戰鬥姿態的燧石小姐我還是第一次見到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這矯健的身姿，凌厲的拳風......啊，這不就是我在尋找的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"燧石小姐，不，能征善戰的勇士啊！你的經歷一定非同凡響，我想要瞭解你的英雄事蹟，能與我分享一二嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"英雄？我沒見過什麼英雄，你說的我聽不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你要這些什麼......事蹟有用嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正在尋找能給予我靈感的英雄事蹟，為了幫助我創作出一部偉大的詩篇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，明白了，你是想要靈感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"那你過來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"過來，站這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"這是沙袋，揍它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......這樣嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"力氣太小了，用點勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"還不夠，再用力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！疼疼疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"對，就是這樣，你感覺到什麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"還有呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能，你沒有感受到靈感嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，我打拳的時候就會有很多靈感，比如說會突然想到，下一次可以佯攻面門而直擊下盤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"任何麻煩應該都能用拳頭來解決，我想想，應該是你打得太少了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"來，再多打幾拳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先停一停......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"燧石，燧石，你在裡面嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"我在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，埃拉托，帕拉斯，兩位也在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"燧石，這是上一次外勤任務的賠償清單，你好好看看。為了處理你出外勤留下的麻煩，後勤部又多了一大筆支出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"特別是這一項，你在任務報告中寫的是：“因為那個高個子的傢伙眼神兇惡地俯視我，我就把他打倒了。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你何止是把他打倒了，他可是痛得滿地打滾，足足撞爛了兩扇門！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能，我明明收了力的。你看，我就是這麼打了兩下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，以後出外勤任務，千萬要注意不要破壞公物，要是再有下次——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙袋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被一拳打爆了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，算了。燧石，這個給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"上次外勤任務中，你救下的那個女孩寄給你的感謝信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"（把信塞進拳套裡）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"我去換個新沙袋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，埃拉托小姐，我的選擇沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與你同行實在盡興，甚至勝過在艦橋上自斟自飲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你們祭司都這樣說話，還是只有你這麼無聊，“勝利女神”小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，我是獨一無二的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下個地方到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島上有不少厲害的工程師，在這裡一定能找到——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！帕拉斯，埃拉托，兩位，早上好啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，賈維，這裡只有你在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛奧斯塔還在呢？欸，他去哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧斯塔，你在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，不用麻煩叫他出來啦，我就問你好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你......應該還挺擅長機械設計吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然了，小爺我的改裝技術可是一等一的，稱之為天才也不為過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，我有個問題想問你，你有沒有覺得自己有過什麼英雄事蹟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，幫我拿著這個。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......液壓鉗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是問我的改裝技術嗎？我學修車的時候師傅曾經說過，嘴上吹得再好聽，都不如親手做一遍來得實在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，我是想詢問英雄......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿好了，我這就給你演示一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"演示什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它怎麼、怎麼飛起來了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣？這就是我的最新作品，自懸浮液壓鉗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小爺我在這裡工作，經常要對付一些大型設備，每次都要帶著工具爬梯子實在是太麻煩了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，只要抓住經過我改裝的這套工具，身體就能跟著飄起來！去再高的地方都不用搬梯子了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓穩了！它還能飄得更高！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它、它在震動，這正常嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"震動......我記得我沒裝轉子電機啊？等等，我到底裝了沒有......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它開始亂晃了！我抓不住了，要放手了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！液壓鉗朝你飛過去了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"痛，痛，我的腦袋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼會出現這種故障呢？奇怪，是不是噴氣引擎功率太大了？算了，等一下再說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛是不是問我，我有沒有什麼英雄事蹟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小爺我必須自豪地告訴你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個回答倒是意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是因為，我的心血全部獻給了我改裝的這些機械設備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們才是真正的英雄，代替我成就了許多前無古人的壯舉！我的改裝才是應該被所有人銘記的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於我......我發明了它們，那我就應該算是......嗯......“英雄創造者”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，這個稱號還不賴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“英雄創造者”？嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧斯塔！你那聲“嘁”是什麼意思？你不認可我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的英雄們是指會唱歌的電鑽，還是會跳舞的扳手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，現在又多了一個會飛行的液壓鉗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，奧斯塔，你怎麼能這麼貶低你的頭兒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據我的統計，你上一次收到改裝的需求，還是......三個月前？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好好回憶一下，我一定還有做得很好的改裝吧！一定有吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"承認吧，賈維，你已經沒救了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，桌子上的這個頭盔......我似乎在前不久的一次外勤任務中見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時那位重裝幹員非常氣憤地說：“我只是想修一下護目鏡，那傢伙竟然給我加了一大堆亂七八糟的功能！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而在任務中，小隊遭遇意料之外的源石污染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在未攜帶專業源石探測裝備的情況下，頭盔的源石探測功能起了作用，幫助小隊渡過了危機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧斯塔，你聽見了嗎？我還是有能幫上忙的地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這個頭盔為什麼被送了回來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得，在任務的後半程頭盔漏電了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不論如何，我是不會放棄發揮我的創意的，我的天賦絕不能被掩埋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總有一天，小爺我也配得上堂堂正正的英雄之名，而不是什麼，“英雄創造者”之類的。奧斯塔，你就等著瞧好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，差點忘了你們還在了。抱歉啊，埃拉托，沒給你你要的英雄事蹟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我想到了，你們想要詢問英雄事蹟的話，我有一個人選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是哪位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是小爺我的摯友，Lancet-2！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她最近格外消極啊，明明工作非常努力的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過她是不是一直都很消極......如果你們可以向她瞭解一些她的英雄事蹟，說不定她就能開心一點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有空常來玩啊，有想要改裝的玩意也儘管找我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃拉托小姐，你真的打算聽賈維的建議嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然啦，在我的計劃裡，要去的最後一個地方恰好也是醫療室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這趟“旅程”至今，原諒我用了傳統的“旅程”一詞，你覺得會對你的創作有所幫助嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在過去我收集了許多傳說與故事，為了將它們完好地保存下來，我會努力把自己當作一個忠實的記錄者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不在記錄中摻雜主觀的情緒與思考，讓故事能保持它原本的樣貌，這是我的訣竅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當旅途告一段落時，那些我所見證的，所聽聞的，所記錄的，最終會在幾個夜晚沉澱下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而後，在筆下流淌為詩歌，以我之口向眾生訴說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這趟“旅程”還未結束，所以我不知道最後會有怎樣的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記錄、創作與傳頌，你讓自己肩負了遠超一名吟遊詩人的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我熱衷於此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你的自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我有一種預感，這次的所見所聞會給我的創作帶來些許不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先前我只是好奇你的創作過程，現在你會寫出怎樣的詩篇，我也很有興趣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"該怎麼辦，該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Lancet-2，你好......你在幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位好，根據我的運動模組顯示的狀態，我在轉圈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看得出來，可是，你為什麼要轉圈呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，因為博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士他出什麼狀況了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，是因為我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"是因為無能的、沒有作用的、什麼都做不好的我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我們好好說清楚可以嗎？究竟是發生了什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕拉斯，你說我這樣拍兩下，Lancet-2能正常說話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以試試。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"語言模組自檢中——自檢完畢，恢復運行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"原因是，博士他最近實在太忙了，每天都要處理好多文件，直到凌晨才能上床休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣下去，下一次博士的體檢結果一定會出現異常指標的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"都是我不好，沒有照顧好博士，都怪我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Lancet-2，博士有他的職責，他的工作對我們所有人都非常重要，偶爾有忙碌的時候也是正常狀況哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不應該把這樣的情況怪罪在自己的頭上，你也在很努力地工作啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？埃拉托幹員，你真的是這麼認為的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然啦，我這次前來就是想找你幫忙的。請問你有什麼可以分享給我的英雄事蹟嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"英雄事蹟......在看護的時候我有聽見幹員們的閒聊，在我的儲存模組中應該保存有一些事件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，不需要那些。我想要瞭解的是，你覺得自己做得好的，像英雄一樣的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Lancet-2的工作那麼出色，這樣的事情一定不少吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"我的英雄事蹟......不，我應該沒有足以稱之為英雄事蹟的行為，我連英雄都稱不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"在我的崗位上，能把所有幹員都照顧得很好，讓大家都保持健康，才能被稱為英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"而我沒有這樣的事蹟，我照顧不好博士......我是不是根本就不稱職......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她真的很消極。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦，Lancet-2，要不這樣，請你也照看我一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"照顧埃拉托幹員嗎？這的確在我的工作範圍內，但是......你讓我這麼做有什麼理由嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣我就會告訴你，你做得到底好不好，或許Lancet-2就能體會到自己也是很有用的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了，我馬上對埃拉托幹員進行全身生理檢測，請稍等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"檢測——完成。檢測結果顯示，埃拉托幹員有27小時13分鐘27秒沒有進入過睡眠狀態，身體嚴重缺乏休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"......埃拉托幹員在數小時前攝入了大量糖分，以及脂肪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃拉托小姐，你上次可是口口聲聲說要減肥的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是為了構思，為了構思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會這樣？我竟然沒有及時發現埃拉托幹員的異常......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"你一進來我就該發現的，可是我忙於處理自己的情緒模組，沒有照看好你......我太不稱職了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，這不是你的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，我什麼作用都起不了，我就該自己駛向報廢區域的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"埃拉托，帕拉斯，你們好。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"埃拉托，帕拉斯，你們也在這裡啊。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托&帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Lancet-2，我來體檢了......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你看起來狀態不太好，有什麼心事嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......對不起，我沒有照顧好你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"多虧Lancet-2的幫助，我的體檢結果一直正常。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，竟然是這樣的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"短暫的時間內，你完成了體檢的全部內容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"體檢結果出來了，各項數據指標——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"一切正常。太好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我都說了，不用擔心。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"完全沒有擔心的必要。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"（減少了博士的咖啡配給，果然還是有用的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Lancet-2的工作真的很出色啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"埃拉托，你還好嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉，我剛剛只是在思考......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我有點事，先離開了！再見！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"好，再見。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"narration","text":"一周後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來不止小爺我，大家都收到邀請了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"“詩篇吟誦會”邀請，我不懂，什麼是詩篇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"是一種用凝練語言敘述事件或表達情緒的文學體裁，聽眾能從詩篇的吟誦中收穫精神的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"這次是埃拉托最新作品的第一次公開朗誦，預計會對幹員們的心理健康帶來積極的影響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"埃拉托的新詩篇嗎......我還挺期待的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雖說給大家都發了邀請，可沒想到竟然來了這麼多人......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝大家參加我的新詩篇吟誦會，願大家在此度過一段愜意的時光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，話不多說，下面我將為大家吟誦的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊，好緊張，上一次在這麼多人面前吟誦新詩，還是好多年前在科林尼亞的城市廣場......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"埃拉托！埃拉托！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，下面，我將為大家吟誦的是，我最新創作的詩篇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《英雄們的敘事詩》。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"遼遠的天穹啊，\n請歌唱在你之下，\n那些平凡人類的意志。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在極遠的邊陲之地，\n群山不再，\n唯餘一片黃沙與黑色石礫掩埋的荒原。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"文明正遭受苦難鞭打，\n掙扎如酒漿中的泡沫，\n無形怪物吞噬鮮活的心跳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然後在一個出人意料的夏夜，\n它發生了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三位英雄，\n自生養他們的人民中走出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他們面對陽光立下誓言，\n要率領人民打碎桎梏，\n前往鮮花盛開之地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伴隨著豎琴聲與埃拉托輕緩的吟誦，三位英雄的故事被娓娓道來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他們從人民中來，\n並不高大，\n並非完美無缺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"善戰的勇士不善言辭，性子衝動。\n天才的工匠粗心自大，我行我素。\n仁愛的醫生過分自卑，語言消極。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然而，當無數危機接踵而來時。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"勇士毫不畏懼向遠比自己高大的敵人發起挑戰。\n工匠以一件妙手偶得的器具幫助人們脫離險境。\n醫生盡心盡力地照護每一位受病痛折磨的患者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他們從人民中來，\n並不高大，\n並非完美無缺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他們正帶領人們前行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黎明掀開她的面紗，太陽的光輝灑向大地，拂過灰塵遮蔽的臉龐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遠方飄來芬芳，人們拾起行囊，將繼續踏上道路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝大家，謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"詩篇吟誦會告一段落，大家戀戀不捨地離去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，帕拉斯，之前我就把詩篇讀給你聽了，過去了兩三天，你還沒有什麼想法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我沒聽錯，這只是詩篇的第一節。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須承認，詩篇很有你的風格，但在你的詩篇完成之前，我決定不予評價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能讓喋喋不休的帕拉斯把評價吞進肚子裡，應該還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起和你拌嘴，我更想知道你打算如何完成詩篇後續的創作。上一次收集到的素材應該不足以支撐後續寫作吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，所以現在我的確沒有更多的靈感，只有一個我一直都很喜歡的構想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要創作一個以我自己為原型的角色，在故事中與英雄們一起，同行至鮮花盛開的理想之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米諾斯人都曾夢想過與英雄同行，我理解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......和過去不一樣，你應該記得我和你說過，這一次的創作會有所不同。可我創作的詩篇和過去相比並沒有改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在寫作時我一直思索這個預感從何而來，直到放下筆的刹那，我忽然明白，那份不同或許早已發生在我的身旁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過去的旅途中，我將自己寫進故事，成為故事中的角色，期待著凝結心血的創作能引導與鼓舞人們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但身處此地，第一次認真地觀察過羅德島上的大家後，我發現......我的詩意產生了前所未有的共鳴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我已經置身於英雄之間，正與英雄們同行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應當將其記敘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_285_medic2","aliases":["Lancet-2"]},{"speakerId":"char_415_flint","aliases":["燧石"]}]}
